nHmm, but the other three reports give fair values of 43.6亿 (27.1元×1.6094), 47.3亿 (段永平 29.4元), 45亿 (芒格). The other three use PE 18-22x for 中性.\n\nThe instruction: 四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点. 李录's basis for different view: risk aversion, 供应商集中 46%, trade discount PE 15-20x vs others' 18-22x. That's a legitimate, evidence-based difference. But the difference should be modest and acknowledged.\n\nGiven the three new reports converge on 内在涨幅 +2% ~ +10%, and 击球区 all 🟡, and 建仓价 23~25.5元, 补仓价 20~21.5元:\n\nFor alignment, I'd set 李录's:\n- 内在涨幅: **+2%** (most conservative, aligns with 巴菲特's +2% and 芒格's lower bound) — or express as \"约+2%~+5%（报+2%）\". Let me keep it as **+2%** with explanation that range is -5%~+15% (芒格) and his conservative framework lands at lower bound. Actually the old one was -10% which was based on pre-split stale data and a lower PE. Updating data to post-split: current price 26.6元, fair value... \n\nHmm, let me be careful. 李录's framework with updated 2026E:\n- 2026E 归母: 保守 2.0亿 / 中性 2.2亿 / 乐观 2.5亿 (aligned with 段永平's 2.0/2.2/2.5)\n- EPS (1.6094亿股): 1.24 / 1.37 / 1.55\n- PE for trade distributor: 李录 uses 15-20x; others use 18-22x. 李录 with 15/18/20:\n  - 保守: 15x × 2.0 = 30亿 → 18.6元\n  - 中性: 18x × 2.2 = 39.6亿 → 24.6元\n  - 乐观: 20x × 2.5 = 50亿 → 31.1元\n  - 加权 (30%/45%/25%): 9 + 17.82 + 12.5 = 39.32亿 → 24.4元 → 内在涨幅 = 24.4/26.6 - 1 = -8.3%\n\nHmm that gives negative. But the other three reports' consensus fair value is ~27.1-29.4元. The instruction says to align unless evidence-based difference. 李录's framework does give evidence for a lower multiple (trade discount). But being -8% when everyone else is +2%~+10%... The old report had -10% and that was called \"内容已过时\" — outdated. The main outdatedness: pre-split prices, pre-split market cap, old PE 20.4 based on pre-split, 减持 data now confirmed, Q2 deceleration evidence new, 可转债 4.3亿→6.25亿→4.3亿 changes, PB 67.59% percentile discovery, etc.\n\nThe task explicitly says: \"重写...使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐：同一只股票的同一次